FcQojj-fYCpl2eGS0X6Gow729mLPbgzCI7qqAKRrUA9A&oe=6A8C2784"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J0IvyZF5fu8Q7kNvwFmHrNN&_nc_oc=Adr-G9xlsJE1EafsGd0tXGdNgEHxvO4cccmhZDIydMOCq8xNfyfRQPxJzTzH2WBtVjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHkFk72Aw7pqfRhxTFnDI1wj8A1FGUvdP1PwwVintEEkw&oe=6A8C4462"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iypWcf_2E60Q7kNvwELW22h&_nc_oc=AdrDtXsosFRNgdYemhdLM1L_KFVhovkc8xQZsgBcYsb3cmZSAGQU0RubKhuk19T4sIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFwJExQn3kolwrYkFmV0xWLqaB-OXc3AD6zs7YI037fbA&oe=6A8C2E73"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kAPrwTQO1PwQ7kNvwFKgl7H&_nc_oc=AdrnW36V4LTK9Qago2sZtWIiqXmTAau8nSufCJNolFWzikHWd7PyZ8wkIHew36E1iCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZJAAbUiRuVN3_gTE5klP5w3o0B6vRJNh5HPNftkeYAg&oe=6A8C2D6F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XOkwkKMXEFYQ7kNvwHhzlSQ&_nc_oc=Adoo-z-Hv3raHwHJrEmep53YX3fuETivbLvqudYM-tK-ZMeRFdZ4VdSV_2u38--BP2w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFYE1w6YzyfqAJv1i4tfNky80VPIegHeA2NRzM7yx2pGw&oe=6A8C2965"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4MTCceR7KigQ7kNvwHqFVjK&_nc_oc=AdrrCkHC6TrhCXxhxCmPvbd5xsNLwd9CgTdpHBTR44UKJQy7lDGuzmjZr5XxljULhfE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGS-NLvRQpf_34ULkU0pWa_EcRnV3jLYVcJFINeCkC-YA&oe=6A8C284D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HCyHiYncnQYQ7kNvwFwFj_g&_nc_oc=Adp-1R1V4ajiGvhGzO4b9BI6dDv84iYCMGu4wywckrrD4w_BrLrInuu8QiMmMM2NiA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=